 pkgconf, g++ (>= 12), libyaml-cpp-dev, libopencv-dev (>= 4.6),
 libavcodec-dev, libavutil-dev, libswscale-dev,
 libboost-system-dev, libssl-dev (>= 3.0), libsystemd-dev,
 libegl-dev, libgles-dev, libcamera-dev [arm64],
 python3, python3-numpy, python3-opencv (>= 4.6), python3-yaml, python3-cryptography
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: nuvo-depth
Architecture: arm64
Depends: nuvo-depth-core (= ${binary:Version}),
 nuvo-depth-platform-pi5 (= ${binary:Version}),
 nuvo-depth-gateway (= ${binary:Version}),
 libnuvo-depth1 (= ${binary:Version}), python3-nuvo-depth (= ${source:Version}),
 nuvo-depth-calibration (= ${source:Version}), nuvo-depth-tools (= ${source:Version}),
 ${misc:Depends}
Description: Nuvo Depth stereo camera appliance metapackage
 Installs the supported Raspberry Pi 5 capture, depth, secure gateway, SDK,
 calibration, and diagnostic components as one versioned cohort.

Package: nuvo-depth-core
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-yaml,
 nuvo-depth-calibration (= ${source:Version})
Conflicts: nuvo-depthd (<< 0.1.1~)
Replaces: nuvo-depthd (<< 0.1.1~)
Provides: nuvo-depthd
Recommends: nuvo-depth-gateway (= ${binary:Version})
Description: Nuvo Depth native capture and processing core
 Owns stereo capture, pairing, rectification, disparity, depth products,
 bounded IPC storage, configuration, and the native service unit.

Package: nuvo-depth-platform-pi5
Architecture: arm64
Depends: nuvo-depth-core (= ${binary:Version}), raspi-config, iw, rfkill, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Raspberry Pi 5 platform integration for Nuvo Depth
 Contains the libcamera/GPIO capture backend and opt-in platform preparation
 assets. Installation alone never modifies Raspberry Pi boot configuration.

Package: nuvo-depth-gateway
Architecture: any
Depends: nuvo-depth-core (= ${binary:Version}), nuvo-depth-tools (= ${source:Version}),
 ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: avahi-daemon
Description: Nuvo Depth secure HTTPS gateway and web console
 Serves authenticated camera status and associated NuvoStream frame snapshots
 over Ethernet or USB Ethernet without direct camera-device access.

Package: libnuvo-depth1
Section: libs
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Nuvo Depth host stream decoder ABI
 Stable bounded C ABI for incrementally decoding NuvoStream messages.

Package: libnuvo-depth-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Depends: libnuvo-depth1 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: Nuvo Depth SDK development files
 C and C++ headers plus pkg-config metadata for host integrations.

Package: python3-nuvo-depth
Section: python
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), ${misc:Depends}
Description: Python client SDK for Nuvo Depth cameras
 Strict HTTPS client, associated frame-set decoder, and recording primitives.

Package: nuvo-depth-calibration
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-numpy, python3-opencv (>= 4.6), python3-yaml,
 python3-cryptography, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Nuvo Depth stereo calibration workflow
 Synchronized target-pair solving, profile-matrix generation, quantitative validation,
 immutable bundle activation,
 tamper detection, and atomic calibration rollback.

Package: nuvo-depth-tools
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-yaml, openssl (>= 3.0), network-manager,
 dnsmasq-base, iptables, iproute2, avahi-daemon,
 python3-nuvo-depth (= ${source:Version}),
 nuvo-depth-calibration (= ${source:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: Nuvo Depth administration and diagnostic tools
 Appliance identity, platform preflight/preparation, transport transactions,
 recorder/replay entry points, and support diagnostics.

Package: nuvo-depth-factory
Architecture: all
Depends: nuvo-depth-calibration (= ${source:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: Restricted Nuvo Depth factory provisioning policy
 Documents the separate signed factory-calibration and production-test
 boundary. It grants no factory authority merely by being installed.
